#> 3  mpg gear  numeric  ordinal Kendall tau-b  0.4048  FALSE
#> 4  cyl   am  ordinal   binary Kendall tau-b -0.5334  FALSE
#> 5  cyl gear  ordinal  ordinal Kendall tau-b -0.5431  FALSE
